  "content_html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzrlPlBuObrefcuqBsb-DT3nOgau-GsuOpJoRqsjq5GseZjQwb0xbRbFyikMZMzBeeWZ37XZfLI-JnH7LLoHeGTulj26jpr5V88i-mq80NsnwzmXSFFaVOkXG-08-0y5cPAlVByEP9C4-xkXAkcu4qvISEppO27u-C8cldi-EByv8qx7hxMWm-bFTPvhE/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2019,%202025,%2002_12_44%20PM.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"תרשים עץ משפחתי בסגנון תנ&quot;כי על קלף, מציג את הירושה במשפחת אלעזר\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzrlPlBuObrefcuqBsb-DT3nOgau-GsuOpJoRqsjq5GseZjQwb0xbRbFyikMZMzBeeWZ37XZfLI-JnH7LLoHeGTulj26jpr5V88i-mq80NsnwzmXSFFaVOkXG-08-0y5cPAlVByEP9C4-xkXAkcu4qvISEppO27u-C8cldi-EByv8qx7hxMWm-bFTPvhE/w213-h320/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2019,%202025,%2002_12_44%20PM.png\" width=\"213\" /></a></div></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">5 מקרים מהחיים שממחישים את עקרונות הירושה בתורה</span></h2><blockquote><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֶל בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל תְּדַבֵּר לֵאמֹר אִישׁ כִּי יָמוּת וּבֵן אֵין לוֹ וְהַעֲבַרְתֶּם אֶת נַחֲלָתוֹ לְבִתּוֹ</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם אֵין לוֹ  בַּת וּנְתַתֶּם אֶת נַחֲלָתוֹ לְאֶחָיו</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם אֵין לוֹ אַחִים וּנְתַתֶּם אֶת נַחֲלָתוֹ לַאֲחֵי אָבִיו</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם אֵין אַחִים לְאָבִיו וּנְתַתֶּם אֶת נַחֲלָתוֹ לִשְׁאֵרוֹ הַקָּרֹב אֵלָיו מִמִּשְׁפַּחְתּוֹ וְיָרַשׁ אֹתָהּ</span></div></blockquote><div><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אירוע 1 - מות אלעזר</span></h3><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlNqG32i9PVxTZ4Hf-fI3TamPhYGTb3IDedFJ0bzt4cmgTsIlkCNfaOlPTnwj47tr_3_Oz9itvI61wpfFwT4UbfFAca3Z_uwfRMCmdR0eGCMdOtkgvBEerrXvi-oYrpS9q2gDn87UMAWf2I9wADdvP0VW8fgkY62Tzx4BhYFxtfwp6w8BgR1AXD_l7148/s360/1.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"338\" data-original-width=\"360\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlNqG32i9PVxTZ4Hf-fI3TamPhYGTb3IDedFJ0bzt4cmgTsIlkCNfaOlPTnwj47tr_3_Oz9itvI61wpfFwT4UbfFAca3Z_uwfRMCmdR0eGCMdOtkgvBEerrXvi-oYrpS9q2gDn87UMAWf2I9wADdvP0VW8fgkY62Tzx4BhYFxtfwp6w8BgR1AXD_l7148/s320/1.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">כל השאר חיים</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">יורשים: משה ומנחם</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">סיבה:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">הירושה \"יורדת\" לצאצאים של אלעזר. ה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">בת (רחל) אינה יורשת אם יש בנים (משה ומנחם).</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">אירוע 2 מות משה (אירוע חדש - לא המשך מקודמו)</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjZSGqxuyfzBfBUzy5Kr7CYGFk7U7pKnMpd2MSvZAPnZyS2hpY0enDis1jSIFlb2OvhhKAfYxXGWDV94UE1wHqlZrQWFawFc6BIfjNrOwnnVMthz9Wye6oWfNXHC-Bjinq4gjDzuh8RlIqL7AZHEI4mFrrIiOeeOlyzhD9DCpkndcL7eXRlT1lv95nUA3M/s352/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"346\" data-original-width=\"352\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjZSGqxuyfzBfBUzy5Kr7CYGFk7U7pKnMpd2MSvZAPnZyS2hpY0enDis1jSIFlb2OvhhKAfYxXGWDV94UE1wHqlZrQWFawFc6BIfjNrOwnnVMthz9Wye6oWfNXHC-Bjinq4gjDzuh8RlIqL7AZHEI4mFrrIiOeeOlyzhD9DCpkndcL7eXRlT1lv95nUA3M/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-family: arial; font-size: large; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">כל השאר חיים</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">יורשים</span><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">: יפית ואלונה</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">סיבה</span><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">: </span><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הירושה \"יורדת\" לצאצאים של משה. ה</span><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">בנות (יפית ואלונה) יורשות אם אין אחים בנים.</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אירוע 3 מות יפית </span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">(אירוע חדש - לא המשך מקודמו)</span></h3><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjTWzZWxTiPQvEjD7CPcUyjyReJJuU3lYOUj4_c